WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.120
You are awake.

2
00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:07.123
That is the simple truth of this moment.

3
00:00:08.823 --> 00:00:13.456
You do not have to decide yet what it means for tomorrow.

4
00:00:15.856 --> 00:00:19.993
Let the screen rest face down or dim.

5
00:00:21.693 --> 00:00:28.711
Settle in a position that is as comfortable as it can reasonably be.

6
00:00:30.411 --> 00:00:33.091
This practice does not promise sleep.

7
00:00:34.791 --> 00:00:40.289
Its purpose is to make a little less struggle around being awake.

8
00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:53.694
Feel where the bed receives your weight.

9
00:00:55.394 --> 00:01:05.828
Notice the back of the head, the shoulders, the back, the hips, the legs, or whatever points are clear.

10
00:01:07.528 --> 00:01:12.200
You do not need to scan them all.

11
00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:16.060
Choose one place that feels neutral enough.

12
00:01:32.628 --> 00:01:36.756
Let the breath move without making it deeper.

13
00:01:38.456 --> 00:01:43.809
At night, effort can become another source of wakefulness.

14
00:01:45.509 --> 00:01:50.464
Allow breathing to be small, uneven, or ordinary.

15
00:02:10.346 --> 00:02:24.436
If the mind is calculating hours, planning tomorrow, or asking why you are still awake, notice that this is what minds do when certainty is unavailable.

16
00:02:26.136 --> 00:02:31.224
You do not need to answer every question in the dark.

17
00:02:33.624 --> 00:02:37.427
Silently offer the words, not now.

18
00:02:39.127 --> 00:02:46.624
Not as a command, but as permission to postpone the problem until daylight.

19
00:03:06.506 --> 00:03:11.644
Listen for the quietest sound you can hear.

20
00:03:13.344 --> 00:03:16.264
Then notice the space around that sound.

21
00:03:17.964 --> 00:03:20.684
Let hearing be broad and easy.

22
00:03:42.774 --> 00:03:44.734
Return to the bed holding you.

23
00:03:46.434 --> 00:03:49.314
Imagine no sinking and no special heaviness.

24
00:03:51.014 --> 00:03:57.712
Simply notice that you are not required to hold all of your weight by yourself.

25
00:04:19.802 --> 00:04:25.440
If restlessness is strong, a small change of position is allowed.

26
00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:33.358
Move slowly enough to feel the movement, then let the body settle again.

27
00:04:35.058 --> 00:04:39.905
There is no perfect position you must find.

28
00:04:56.473 --> 00:05:01.386
For the next few breaths, count only the exhale.

29
00:05:03.086 --> 00:05:04.046
One.

30
00:05:05.746 --> 00:05:07.946
Then begin again at one.

31
00:05:09.646 --> 00:05:15.184
There is nowhere to reach and no need to remember the previous number.

32
00:05:48.319 --> 00:05:53.367
Thoughts can pass through like distant rooms with lights on.

33
00:05:55.067 --> 00:06:00.155
You do not have to enter each room.

34
00:06:01.855 --> 00:06:04.935
Feel one point of contact.

35
00:06:06.635 --> 00:06:07.915
Hear one sound.

36
00:06:09.615 --> 00:06:11.015
Receive one breath.

37
00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:53.661
If you notice yourself checking whether the practice is working, include that too.

38
00:06:55.361 --> 00:06:59.253
Checking is another thought, not a verdict.

39
00:07:00.953 --> 00:07:14.034
Return to something that does not need an answer: the temperature around your hands, the weight of the blanket, or the quiet movement of an exhale.

40
00:07:41.647 --> 00:07:44.727
Let time be unmeasured for a while.

41
00:07:46.427 --> 00:07:50.760
You do not need to know how many minutes have passed.

42
00:07:52.460 --> 00:07:57.178
The night can be made of this one breath, and then another.

43
00:07:58.878 --> 00:08:05.135
Each moment of resting is still rest, even when sleep has not arrived.

44
00:08:38.271 --> 00:08:40.911
You may fall asleep.

45
00:08:42.611 --> 00:08:44.211
You may remain awake.

46
00:08:45.911 --> 00:08:50.774
Either way, this moment can contain less argument.

47
00:08:53.174 --> 00:08:55.334
Let the next pause be longer.

48
00:08:57.034 --> 00:08:59.394
The practice can continue without your help.

49
00:09:49.097 --> 00:09:50.737
Nothing to finish.

50
00:09:52.437 --> 00:09:53.717
Nothing to prove.

51
00:09:55.417 --> 00:10:00.000
Just the body here, held for another ordinary night.
